    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;Contact process: Industrial method to prepare <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> in presence of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub></math>.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;Wacker oxidation: Conversion of ethylene to acetaldehyde by an acidic, aqueous solution of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> .<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>iii</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;Ziegler-Natta catalyst is used to polymerize terminal alkenes (ethylene and alkenes with the vinyl double bond).<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mrow><menclose notation=\"horizontalstrike\"><mo>[</mo></menclose><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><menclose notation=\"horizontalstrike\"><mo>]</mo></menclose></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>iv</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;Haber process: Haber process is used to form <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> in presence of Iron oxide.",
